Z||000002||fiero56||05-24-2000||09:48 PM||||Of course FOCOA is still around! I was at nationals last year in Columbus.  Had a GREAT time!!! Several hundred beautiful Fieros, great people, TONS of vendors... It was a blast. I already have my schedule set up so I can attend the show this year. I can't wait for it I am so excited. I want to see all of you there too.||||reg||1
